{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:adef89e591c21b09","name":"IT-0 Interrogator Droid","source":{"id":"source:reference-adef89e591c21b09","title":"IT-0 Interrogator Droid","revision":23125,"timestamp":"2024-09-15T19:22:35Z","sha256":"d747045a99487957189920dc8e266ff347cdf267aeb190c6dac7ab611f929e02","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=23125","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=IT-0%20Interrogator%20Droid&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-adef89e591c21b09","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Unleashed Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Empire","referenceId":"reference:f9c9a48674cc3415"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Imperial Security Bureau"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Imperial_Security_Bureau","referenceId":"reference:6248e34cdab1a02e"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["COMPNOR"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/COMPNOR","referenceId":"reference:ed93589b6825aa68"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["With much the same programming and equipment as a Medical Droid, an IT-0 Droid seems harmless enough in technological terms. Its sinister appearance, however, gives away its true function. A floating ball of black durasteel, an IT-0 Interrogator Droid bristles with instruments of torture and recording devices. Its claw, shock devices, and twisted versions of medical gear are designed to give it an aura of menace. Indeed, its reputation has spread far enough that many prisoners begin reciting their sins as soon as one floats into their cell.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The IT-0 Interrogator is the product of Imperial military research and the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Imperial Security Bureau"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Imperial_Security_Bureau","referenceId":"reference:6248e34cdab1a02e"},", and it is manufactured solely by Imperial factories. Use of the IT-0 is carefully controlled by the ISB, though models do get into the hands of senior Moffs, military intelligence, and even ",{"tag":"a","children":["CompForce"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/CompForce"},". ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Inquisitorius"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Inquisitorius","referenceId":"reference:322ca1aa843ce214"}," has begun manufacturing the model on its own, a fact the ISB is not aware of and won't be pleased by. ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stormtrooper"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stormtrooper","referenceId":"reference:9d7164e03c073efe"}," garrison commanders are also known to employ them, though generally only under the guidance of a senior officer.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Droid can interrogate a prisoner by itself, or in conjunction with living questioners. It is designed with an emotionless personality and asks questions in a flat monotone. When working with a living assistant, the IT-0 often says nothing at all, allowing the prisoner to come to fear and hate the Droid, while seeing the living interrogator as a source of potential mercy. An IT-0 is well equipped to bring a victim to the brink of physical damage without doing permanent harm, though it also has medical supplies and training in case a session goes too far before valuable information can be obtained.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["IT-0 Interrogator Droids can by played as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid Heroes"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid_Heroes"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["IT-0 Interrogator Droid Statistics (CL 1)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Normal"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Small ",{"tag":"a","children":["2nd-Degree Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/2nd-Degree_Droid"}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Noble"],"href":"https://swse.mirahe